We=E2=80=99re excited to share that KitBash, the company behind 3D art plat=
forms KitBash3D <https://r.email1.sketchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ4z5Ed8j=
pdRR6TVS1ngk7BaS6U/kJOsjllLmLDT>  and Greyscalegorilla <https://r.email1.sk=
etchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ4zbPDnsbAe3cwe2Shybh8QXXW/RR8xq4VBfB3r> , h=
as acquired Sketchfab and ArtStation.=20




Artists and studios use KitBash3D and Greyscalegorilla to access extensive =
libraries of 3D assets and materials, professional design and animation too=
ls, educational resources, and workflow technology that is integrated direc=
tly into leading creative applications. Together, KitBash3D, Greyscalegoril=
la, Sketchfab, and ArtStation will support artists at every stage of the cr=
eative process from bringing ideas to life to sharing their work and buildi=
ng their careers. =20




This community is central to what makes Sketchfab great and as part of KitB=
ash we will continue to create opportunities for artists to come together, =
collaborate, share and learn. There are no changes to how you access or use=
 Sketchfab and your portfolios, models, embeds, and existing workflows will=
 continue to operate as they do today.=20




Check out the full announcement over on the Sketchfab blog <https://r.email=
1.sketchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ507ZoT1Mhqg9PmctcGTH5GcyY/y2Hbvg3QQUT7>=
 .=20




We=E2=80=99re grateful to the artists and creators who have shaped Sketchfa=
b over the years, and we look forward to this next chapter with KitBash.




The Sketchfab Team

